+# TLS Certificate Verification
+
+TLS certificate verification is required and enforced across all build configurations, including development builds. There is no dev-only exception: a prior workaround that disabled certificate verification for development builds was reverted in favor of enforcing verification uniformly across development, staging, and production, in order to maintain a consistent security posture and avoid the gap created by a dev-only exception.
